  "Description": "OrthoRibbon is a visualization toolkit for displaying\northologous gene relationships across species using\nribbon-based diagrams. It enables intuitive comparison of\nconserved genes and genomic correspondence between chromosomes\nor genomic regions. The package supports flexible input formats\nand produces publication-quality figures for comparative\ngenomics and evolutionary analysis.",
